<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμβῐ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having life</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζηνὸς] ἐργαζομένου ἔμβια τὰ ὑπὸ
					τῷ αἰθέρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					2.19
				</span></i>
			; <i>tenacious of life, established</i>, of trees which will
			bear transplanting, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.6.5
			</span></i>; of cuttings, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.5.3
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ σπέρμα ἔ.
			γένοιτο</span> if the seed should <i>germinate</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.4.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἔ</span>. their <i>living
				and growing</i>, of trees, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				13.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἔ. ὑγρότης</span> the moisture
				<i>necessary to life</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα ἔ. τῇ γῇ πινόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lasting one's whole life</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τιμωρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					78.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. γενέσθαι</span>
			<i>recover consciousness</i> after a swoon, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				2.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
